    "detailed_description": "<i>There they stood all steeped in shame, another victim claimed in my name. </i><br><br><strong>The Murder Hotel</strong> is an interactive Murder Mystery Adventure with a huge twist: A scissors wielding demon is the murderer and you have to blame one of the human guests, forging a plausible theory how they could have done it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/0a3d84dc57890206ddbc3bedd630238c.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div> <br><i>Feel free to call me Gastfenger. I'm the demonic hotelier, at your service.<br><br>Oh, you want to leave already? How amusing.<br>Nobody leaves this place unless I allow it.<br><br>How about you solve 4 murder cases. Easy, you say?<br>There's a twist to them. It is I who murders my own guests.<br>And it's your task to investigate and successfully blame <strong>one of the other guests</strong> as the culprit.<br><br>Defeat your rival and convince the Demon Council to win a case.<br>Lose just once, and you'll stay here, forever!<br><br>Dare challenge me?</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/2bb87e024065753ee438cef93ad200ec.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><li>A demon may be the perpetrator but you can only explain each murder by human methods. Are you up to the challenge?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/25450726603efbaf536f062a0d64693c.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br></li><li>Find out why the murders are happening and how to put an end to them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/c9b25836f3e8f425c03178f86f3e2e19.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br></li><li>Featuring 14 human guests and a handful of demons, all with their own backstories and dark secrets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/625091f13b91f39563f0e71400eb361c.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br></li><li>Find clues in the form of paper words and form your own sentences to interrogate suspects<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/504bd814eb2b46ab9cde616c837405b0.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br></li><li>There's multiple ways and theories to win a trial. Can you find them all?</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/682d301afad49270df5dbe68df95547e.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/21951c985ef0c47aafffde675864b90b.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>There they stood all steeped in shame, another victim claimed in my name. </i><br><br><strong>The Murder Hotel</strong> is an interactive Murder Mystery Adventure with a huge twist: A scissors wielding demon is the murderer and you have to blame one of the human guests, forging a plausible theory how they could have done it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/0a3d84dc57890206ddbc3bedd630238c.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div> <br><i>Feel free to call me Gastfenger. I'm the demonic hotelier, at your service.<br><br>Oh, you want to leave already? How amusing.<br>Nobody leaves this place unless I allow it.<br><br>How about you solve 4 murder cases. Easy, you say?<br>There's a twist to them. It is I who murders my own guests.<br>And it's your task to investigate and successfully blame <strong>one of the other guests</strong> as the culprit.<br><br>Defeat your rival and convince the Demon Council to win a case.<br>Lose just once, and you'll stay here, forever!<br><br>Dare challenge me?</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/2bb87e024065753ee438cef93ad200ec.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><li>A demon may be the perpetrator but you can only explain each murder by human methods. Are you up to the challenge?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/25450726603efbaf536f062a0d64693c.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br></li><li>Find out why the murders are happening and how to put an end to them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/c9b25836f3e8f425c03178f86f3e2e19.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br></li><li>Featuring 14 human guests and a handful of demons, all with their own backstories and dark secrets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/625091f13b91f39563f0e71400eb361c.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br></li><li>Find clues in the form of paper words and form your own sentences to interrogate suspects<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/504bd814eb2b46ab9cde616c837405b0.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br></li><li>There's multiple ways and theories to win a trial. Can you find them all?</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/682d301afad49270df5dbe68df95547e.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/21951c985ef0c47aafffde675864b90b.avif?t=1754731998\" /></div>",
